# autoresearch/ (2026-09-02, see autoresearch/README.md): per-iteration
# scratch -- the guard arm's run dirs are rewritten every loop iteration,
# and metrics.json/baseline.json are machine-specific GPU output. Only
# autoresearch/results.tsv (the durable experiment log) and the code /
# program.md are tracked.
autoresearch/runs/
autoresearch/logs/
autoresearch/metrics.json
autoresearch/baseline.json

# New campaign (2026-08-15, see campaign/PLAN.md): runs/** was gitignored
# here originally (root disk was 96%/97% full; git blobs are a real,
# avoidable cost, and these runs are regeneratable from the campaign
# scripts + prompts). Un-ignored 2026-08-15 per explicit user request,
# despite that same disk pressure (still ~3.6G free at the time) -- no
# single tracked file exceeds 100MB (checked before this change; largest
# proposals.jsonl traces are ~25MB), but the campaign is still running for
# days and runs/ (397MB and growing) will keep adding to it. Old,
# already-tracked runs under old_runs/ were never affected by this rule.